[0.008, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m ▐\u001b[48;2;0;0;0m▛███▛█\u001b[12G\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[1mClaude Code\u001b[24G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mv2.1.330\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m▝▜\u001b[48;2;0;0;0m█\u001b[7G█\u001b[49m█▀\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mOpus 5.5 with high effort · Claude Pro\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m ▝▝   ▝▝ \u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m~/projects/jett\u001b[28Gson\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;193;7m⚠\u001b[3GCode Mode (experimental) is on · this session can be resumed only with Code Mode on\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mI want to provide a set of standards for the artists to author the assets against. The engine supports Principled \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mBRDF Metal workflow and will have meshlets clusters, cluster forward rendering, raycasting shadows and reflections. \u001b[39m  \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mSuggest a good set of standards, naming conventions, file layouts to keep it all on track. Leave the budgets up to \u001b[39m   \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mthe artists for now. Help me draft a set of standards for the artists to use. I don't think UVs are covered yet but \u001b[39m  \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mwe will need six for some asset types, and perhaps more, so if there is a way to have a flexible number of UVs for a \u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mshader then we need to discuss it and ensure the documentation reflects that method if it is selected.\u001b[39m                \r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mYou should examine industry best practices, but tailor them for this particular engine because this is a greenfield \u001b[39m  \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mproject and shouldn't be weighed down by the decades of tech debt that other engines have incurred.\u001b[39m                   \r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mSuggest the best possible methods, naming schemes, file layouts, etc.\u001b[39m                                                 \r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mBe aware, another session is running at the same time in this project. Be sure to use a spare lane for your work.\u001b[39m     \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m*\u001b[3GGi\u001b[38;2;235;159;127mtif\u001b[38;2;215;119;87mying… \r\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;255;193;7m⏵⏵ auto mode on\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
