ry and material names, and\u001b[91Ga library of material files\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bh\u001b[7Glds \u001b[12Ghe look, so a shared\u001b[33Gmaterial\u001b[42Gis\u001b[45Gchanged\u001b[53Gin\u001b[56Gone\u001b[60Gplace.\u001b[67GIt\u001b[70Galso\u001b[75Gsets\u001b[80Gvalue\u001b[86Granges\u001b[93Gfor\u001b[97Gbase\u001b[102Gcolour,\u001b[110Gmetallic\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gand roughness, and says occlusion maps ho\u001b[47Gd only small cavities.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mTextures:\u001b[15G\u001b[22mPNG sources (16-bit fo\u001b[38G normal and height), power-of-\u001b[69Gwo \u001b[73Gizes, OpenGL\u001b[86Gnormal\u001b[93Gmaps, padding around UV\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bislands.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mUV sets, which is the part to discuss.\u001b[42G\u001b[22mglTF\u001b[47Gallows\u001b[54Gany\u001b[58Gnumber\u001b[65Gof\u001b[68Gsets,\u001b[74Gbut\u001b[78Git\u001b[81Gdoesn't\u001b[89Gname\u001b[94Gthem.\u001b[100GThe\u001b[104Gdraft\u001b[110Gproposes:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GSet\u001b[9G0,\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249munique\u001b[39m,\u001b[20Gis\u001b[23Galways\u001b[30Gpresent\u001b[38Gand\u001b[42Gnon-overlapping;\u001b[59Git's\u001b[64Gwhat\u001b[69Gbakes\u001b[75Gand\u001b[79Gmasks\u001b[85Gread.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- Each asset declares its sets by role\u001b[42Gin its c\u001b[51Gok\u001b[54Gsettings file, for example\u001b[81G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249muvSets: [unique, trim, detail, decal]\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BMa\u001b[8Gerial slots\u001b[20Gpick a set by role (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249muv: trim\u001b[39m), so o\u001b[56Ge l\u001b[60Gbrary material\u001b[75Gworks on assets\u001b[91Gwhose\u001b[97Gsets\u001b[102Gdiffer\u001b[109Gin\u001b[112Gnumber\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gand order.\u001b[16G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
