 also sets\u001b[80Gv\u001b[82Glue r\u001b[89Gges\u001b[93Gfor base colour, metal\u001b[116Gic\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Band roughness, and\u001b[24Gsays occlusion maps hold only small\u001b[60Gcavities.\u001b[70G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mTextures:\u001b[22m PNG sources (16-bit f\u001b[37Gr\u001b[39Gnormal and height), power-of-two\u001b[72Gsizes,\u001b[79GOpenGL\u001b[86Gnormal\u001b[93Gmaps,\u001b[99Gpadding\u001b[107Garound\u001b[114GUV\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gislands.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mUV sets, which is the part to discuss.\u001b[42G\u001b[22mglTF\u001b[47Gallows\u001b[54Gany\u001b[58Gnumber\u001b[65Gof\u001b[68Gsets,\u001b[74Gbut\u001b[78Git\u001b[81Gdoesn't\u001b[89Gname\u001b[94Gthem.\u001b[100GThe\u001b[104Gdraft\u001b[110Gproposes:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- Set 0, \u001b[38;2;177;185;249munique\u001b[39m, is always present and\u001b[42Gnon-overlappi\u001b[56Gg; it's what bakes and masks read.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BEach asset declares its sets by role\u001b[42Gin its cook settings file,\u001b[69Gfor ex\u001b[76Gmple \u001b[38;2;177;185;249muvSets: [unique, trim, detail, decal]\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BM\u001b[7Gterial slots pick\u001b[25Ga \u001b[28Get by\u001b[34Grole (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249muv: trim\u001b[39m), so\u001b[54Gone library material works\u001b[81Gon assets whose sets differ in number\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gand order.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GAt m\u001b[10Gst eight\u001b[19Gsets\u001b[24Gper\u001b[28Gmesh,\u001b[34Gbecause\u001b[42Ga\u001b[44Gmaterial\u001b[53Ghas\u001b[57Geight\u001b[63Gtexture\u001b[71Gslots\u001b[77Gand\u001b[81Ga\u001b[83Gninth\u001b[89Gset\u001b[93Gcould\u001b[99Gnever\u001b[105Gbe\u001b[108Gread.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
