[0.381, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI'\u001b[6Ge drafted the standard in Manifest, where you said it should be defined: \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m../manifest.lane-b/docs/art-standards.md\u001b[39m,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Babout 290 lines,\u001b[20Gon a new b\u001b[31Ganch \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mart-standards\u001b[39m, with a new row in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdocs/README.md\u001b[39m. Nothing is committed, and I've left\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Ba\u001b[5Glane note so\u001b[18Gth\u001b[22Gother session sees\u001b[41Glane\u001b[46GB is taken.\u001b[58GJettison's docs\u001b[74Gare\u001b[78Gunchanged;\u001b[89Gthe\u001b[93Gdoc\u001b[97Gends\u001b[102Gwith\u001b[107Ga\u001b[109Glist\u001b[114Gof\u001b[117Gwhat\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BJettison has to build to\u001b[28Gsupport it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat it covers:\u001b[19G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mTwo trees:\u001b[22m a work tree for \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m.blend\u001b[39m and Subs\u001b[48Gance files,\u001b[60Gand a source tree that\u001b[83Gholds only exports.\u001b[103GThey have to be\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bsepara\u001b[12Ge because the cook\u001b[31Gcopies\u001b[38Gthrough\u001b[46Gany\u001b[50Gfile\u001b[55Git\u001b[58Gdoesn't\u001b[66Grecognise,\u001b[77Gso\u001b[80Ga\u001b[82G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m.blend\u001b[89G\u001b[39mleft\u001b[94Gin\u001b[97Gthe\u001b[101Gsource\u001b[108Gtree\u001b[113Gwould\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gship. The cooked output mirrors the\u001b[41Gsource tree into\u001b[58G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmods/manifest/\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mNames:\u001b[22m k\u001b[14Gbab-case everywh\u001b[31Gre, which the\u001b[46Gook already \u001b[59Gnfor\u001b[65Gs. Asset name\u001b[80Grun general to specifi\u001b[103G with a letter for\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bvariants (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mhauler-a\u001b[39m), kit pieces carry t\u001b[45Geir\u001b[49Gsize\u001b[54G(\