[0.060, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bblend shapes are the one exception: they use\u001b[50GARKit's names exactly.\u001b[73G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mScale and axes:\u001b[22m 1 unit =\u001b[30G1 m, +Y up, nose along −Z (+Y in Blender),\u001b[73Gtransforms\u001b[84Gapplied\u001b[92Gbefore\u001b[99Gexport.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mGeom\u001b[10Gtry for meshlets and ray tracing:\u001b[22m mode\u001b[49G real bevels rather than b\u001b[76Gking them, becaus\u001b[94G ray-traced shadows\u001b[114Gand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gocclusion see only geometry. No hand-made levels of d\u001b[59Gtail or shadow\u001b[74Gproxies. Triangulat\u001b[95Gbefore baking and let the\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bcook make\u001b[15Gth\u001b[19Gtangents. Shadow-casting parts should\u001b[57Gb\u001b[59G closed, an\u001b[71G kit pieces\u001b[83Goverlap slightly at jo\u001b[107Gs\u001b[109Gso light\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bd\u001b[7Gesn't leak through.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mMaterials:\u001b[22m me\u001b[19Gallic-roughness\u001b[35Gonly.\u001b[41GThe\u001b[45GglTF\u001b[50Gcarries\u001b[58Ggeometry\u001b[67Gand\u001b[71Gmaterial\u001b[80Gnames,\u001b[87Gand\u001b[91Ga\u001b[93Glibrary\u001b[101Gof\u001b[104Gmaterial\u001b[113Gfiles\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gholds the look, so a shared material is\u001b[45Gchanged in one place.\u001b[67GIt also sets\u001b[80Gv\u001b[82Glue r\u001b[89Gges\u001b[93Gfor base colour, metal\u001b[116Gic\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Band roughness, and\u001b[24Gsays occlusion maps hold only small\u001b[60Gcavities.\u001b[70G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mTextures:\u001b[22m PNG sources (16-bit f\u001b[37Gr\u001b[39Gnormal and height), power-of-two\u001b[72Gsizes,\u001b[79GOpenGL\u001b[86Gnormal\u001b[93Gmaps,\u001b[99Gpadding\u001b[107Garound\u001b[114GUV\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gislands.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mUV sets, which is the part to discuss.\u001b[42G\u001b[22mglTF\u001b[47Gallows\u001b[54Gany\u001b[58Gnumber\u001b[65Gof\u001b[68Gsets,\u001b[74Gbut\u001b[78Git\u001b[81Gdoesn't\u001b[89Gname\u001b[94Gthem.\u001b[100GThe\u001b[104Gdraft\u001b[110Gproposes:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- Set 0, \u001b[38;2;177;185;249munique\u001b[39m, is always present and\u001b[42Gnon-overlappi\u001b[56Gg; it's what bakes and masks read.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BEach asset declares its sets by role\u001b[42Gin its cook settings file,\u001b[69Gfor ex\u001b[76Gmple \u001b[38;2;177;185;249muvSets: [unique, trim, detail, decal]\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BM\u001b[7Gterial slots pick\u001b[25Ga \u001b[28Get by\u001b[34Grole (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249muv: trim\u001b[39m), so\u001b[54Gone library material works\u001b[81Gon assets whose sets differ in number\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gand order.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GAt m\u001b[10Gst eight\u001b[19Gsets\u001b[24Gper\u001b[28Gmesh,\u001b[34Gbecause\u001b[42Ga\u001b[44Gmaterial\u001b[53Ghas\u001b[57Geight\u001b[63Gtexture\u001b[71Gslots\u001b[77Gand\u001b[81Ga\u001b[83Gninth\u001b[89Gset\u001b[93Gcould\u001b[99Gnever\u001b[105Gbe\u001b[108Gread.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BFor\u001b[7Gthe\u001b[11Gengine,\u001b[19GI\u001b[21Grecommend\u001b[31Ghaving\u001b[38Gthe\u001b[42Gshade\u001b[76Gn\u001b[78Gper-mesh\u001b[87Gbuffer\u001b[94Ginstead\u001b[102Gof\u001b[105Ga\u001b[107Gfixed\u001b[113Gvertex\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
