[46.459, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G-\u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1mgame-integration.md\u001b[39m:\u001b[22m a\u001b[29Ge\u001b[32G\"Art assets\" row\u001b[49Gin the capabili\u001b[65Gy map.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mManifest\u001b[22m (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmanifest.lane-b\u001b[39m, branch \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mart-standards\u001b[39m):\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1mart-standards.md\u001b[39m:\u001b[23G\u001b[22mmarked\u001b[30Gas\u001b[33Gsettled.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G- The art repository\u001b[26Gis Git wi\u001b[36Gh LFS for binary files; \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m.gltf\u001b[39m and \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m.yaml\u001b[76G\u001b[39mstay\u001b[81Gplain\u001b[87Gtext\u001b[92Gso\u001b[95Gchanges\u001b[103Gdiff.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B-\u001b[7GThe\u001b[11GUV\u001b[14Grole\u001b[19Gtable\u001b[25Gis\u001b[28Gthe\u001b[32Gdefault\u001b[40Gfor\u001b[44Gtypical\u001b[52Gassets,\u001b[60Gto\u001b[63Gbe\u001b[66Grefined\u001b[74Gonce\u001b[79Gyou\u001b[83Gknow\u001b[88Gwhich\u001b[94Gclasses\u001b[102Gneed\u001b[107Gsix\u001b[111Gsets.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  - The vertex-pulling design itself now lives only\u001b[55Gin\u001b[58GJ64;\u001b[63Gthe\u001b[67GManifest\u001b[76Gdoc\u001b[80Glinks\u001b[86Gto\u001b[89Git.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mDecision ledger:\u001b[22m a new \"Art\u001b[34Gtandards\"\u001b[44Ggroup\u001b[50Gwith\u001b[55GD-118\u001b[61G(Manifest\u001b[71Gdefines\u001b[79Gthe\u001b[83Gstandards)\u001b[94Gand\u001b[98GD-119\u001b[104G(the\u001b[109Gart\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Brepository on G\u001b[22G LFS).\u001b[29G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BBoth lanes have a note\u001b[26Gso the\u001b[33Go\u001b[35Gh\u001b[37Gr session sees they're taken.\u001b[67G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;38;79;120mRenaming the \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmetallicRoughness\u001b[39m slot to \u001b[38;2;177;185;249morm\u001b[39m \u001b[49min\u001b[49GJ66\u001b[53Gis\u001b[56Gmy\u001b[59Gaddition,\u001b[69Gnot\u001b[73Gsomething\u001b[83Gyou\u001b[87Gasked\u001b[93Gfor.\u001b[98GI\u001b[100Gadded\u001b[106Git\u001b[109Gso\u001b[112Gthe\u001b[116Gslot\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bmatches\u001b[11Gthe\u001b[15Gmap\u001b[19Gword,\u001b[25Gbut\u001b[29Git\u001b[32Gmeans\u001b[38Grewriting\u001b[48Gevery\u001b[54Gexisting\u001b[63Gmaterial\u001b[72Gfile\u001b[77Gin\u001b[80Gboth\u001b[85Grepos\u001b[91Gwhen\u001b[96Git\u001b[99Glands.\u001b[106GShould\u001b[113GI\u001b[115Gcommit\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bb\u001b[8Gbranches?\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBrewed for 2m 52s · done 12:19 pm\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m※\u001b[3G\u001b[1mrecap: \u001b[22m\u001b[3mI'm writing the art standards, defined in Manifest and supported by Jettison. The Manifest doc and Jettison's \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Broadmap items J64 to J67 are drafted, uncommitted, in lanes B and C. Next, you decide whether to commit both branches \r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\u001b[3mand whether to keep the `orm` slot rename. (turn off recaps in /config)\u001b[23m\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
