oves to\u001b[45Gthe s\u001b[51Ga\u001b[53Gdard's layou\u001b[66G, and its content-file\u001b[89Gnaming\u001b[96Grule\u001b[101Gpoints\u001b[108Gto\u001b[111GManifest's\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B \u001b[7Gstandard.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B-\u001b[7G\u001b[1mJ12\u001b[22m (collision\u001b[22Gmesh)\u001b[28Gnow\u001b[32Gnames\u001b[38G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcollision-\u001b[49G\u001b[39mnodes\u001b[55Gas\u001b[58Gthe\u001b[62Gauthor's\u001b[71Gcollision\u001b[81Gmesh.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1mscope.md\u001b[39m:\u001b[22m multiple UV sets\u001b[32Gchanges from Deferred to Open, \u001b[64Gnde\u001b[68G J64.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1mdecisions.md\u001b[39m:\u001b[22m thr\u001b[23Ge settled decisions und\u001b[47Gr Ren\u001b[53Gering: vertex pulling,\u001b[76Gthe\u001b[80Gmaterial\u001b[89Glibrary,\u001b[98Gand\u001b[102GManifest\u001b[111Gdefining\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gthe standards.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1mgame-integration.md\u001b[39m:\u001b[26G\u001b[22ma\u001b[28Gnew\u001b[32G\"Art\u001b[37Gassets\"\u001b[45Grow\u001b[49Gin\u001b[52Gthe\u001b[56Gcapability\u001b[67Gmap.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mManifest\u001b[12G\u001b[22m(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmanifest.lane-b\u001b[39m,\u001b[30Gbranch\u001b[37G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mart-standards\u001b[39m):\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1mart-standards.md\u001b[39m:\u001b[22m marked\u001b[30Gas settled.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G- The art repository is Git\u001b[33Gwi\u001b[36Gh LFS\u001b[42Gfor\u001b[46Gbinary\u001b[53Gfiles;\u001b[60G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m.gltf\u001b[66G\u001b[39mand\u001b[70G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m.yaml\u001b[76G\u001b[39mstay\u001b[81Gplain\u001b[87Gtext\u001b[92Gso\u001b[95Gchanges\u001b[103Gdiff.\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1BUV role table is the default for typ\u001b[76Gce \u001b[80Gou know which classes need six\u001b[111Gsets.