[0.003, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G \u001b[5G- The UV role table is\u001b[28Gthe\u001b[32Gdefault for typical\u001b[52Gassets, to be refined\u001b[74Gonce\u001b[79Gyou\u001b[83Gknow\u001b[88Gwhich\u001b[94Gclasses\u001b[102Gneed\u001b[107Gsix\u001b[111Gsets.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B-\u001b[7GThe\u001b[11Gvertex-pulling\u001b[26Gdesign\u001b[33Gitself\u001b[40Gnow\u001b[44Glives\u001b[50Gonly\u001b[55Gin\u001b[58GJ64;\u001b[63Gthe\u001b[67GManifest\u001b[76Gdoc\u001b[80Glinks\u001b[86Gto\u001b[89Git.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mDeci\u001b[10Gion ledger:\u001b[22m a new \"Art standards\" group with\u001b[55GD-118\u001b[61G(Manifest\u001b[71Gdefines\u001b[79Gthe\u001b[83Gstandards)\u001b[94Gand\u001b[98GD-119\u001b[104G(the\u001b[109Gart\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Grepository on Git\u001b[23GLFS).\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BBoth lanes\u001b[14Ghav\u001b[19Ga note \u001b[27Go the other session sees\u001b[52Gthey're\u001b[61Gaken.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BRenaming the \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmetallicRoughness\u001b[39m slot to \u001b[38;2;177;185;249morm\u001b[39m in J66 is my addition, not som\u001b[77Gthing\u001b[83Gyou asked for.\u001b[98GI added it\u001b[109Gso the\u001b[116Gslot\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bmatche\u001b[10G \u001b[12Ghe map\u001b[19Gword, but\u001b[29Git\u001b[32Gmeans\u001b[38Grewriting\u001b[48Gevery\u001b[54Gexisting\u001b[63Gmaterial\u001b[72Gfile\u001b[77Gin\u001b[80Gboth\u001b[85Grepos\u001b[91Gwhen\u001b[96Git\u001b[99Glands.\u001b[106GShould\u001b[113GI\u001b[115Gcommit\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bboth\u001b[8Gbranches?\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBrewed for 2m 52s · done 12:19 pm\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m※\u001b[3G\u001b[1mrecap: \u001b[22m\u001b[3mI'm writing the art standards, defined in Manifest and supported by Jettison. The Manifest doc and Jettison's \u001b[23m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u00