[0.147, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H     \u001b[2m 600 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m \u001b[18Gar), n\u001b[25Gt from a `.linear.png`\u001b[48Gname;\u001b[54Ga\u001b[56Gmap\u001b[60Gword\u001b[65Gthe\u001b[69Gstandard\u001b[78Glacks\u001b[84Gis\u001b[87Grefused,\u001b[96Gnaming\u001b[103Gthe\u001b[107Gfile.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m601\u001b[12G\u001b[22m \u001b[14G16-bit PNG sources for `norma\u001b[44G` and `h\u001b[53Gight`.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 602 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m- **`orm`.** `mesh`'s `metallicRoughness` texture slot renamed `orm`, its red channel read as         \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 603 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  occlusion, beneath ray-traced and screen-space occlusion; every material file rewritten in the      \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m4\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m \u001b[14Gsame commit ([formats in p\u001b[41Ga\u001b[43Ge](deci\u001b[51Gions.md#p\u001b[61Gr\u001b[63Gis\u001b[66Gence)). A `mask` slot for programs th\u001b[104Gt\u001b[106Gtake\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m5\u001b[15G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mne.      \u001b[25G       \u001b[33G          \u001b[44G   \u001b[48G            \u001b[61G          \u001b[72G     \u001b[78G        \u001b[87G    \u001b[92G         \u001b[102G  \u001b[105G   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 602 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m- **`orm`.** The `orm` slot's red channel read as occlusion in `mesh`, beneath ray-traced and         \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 603 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  screen-space occlusion (the slot was renamed from `metallicRoughness` on 2026-11-27). A `mask`      \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m4\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m \u001b[14Gslot for programs that take\u001b[42Gone.       \u001b[54G    \u001b[59G  \u001b[62G         \u001b[72G  \u001b[75G       \u001b[83G       \u001b[91G          \u001b[102G   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 605 \u001b[22m - **Material extensions.** A glTF source using a material extension is refused, naming it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 606 \u001b[22m - **Role nodes.** `collision-` nodes kept out of the drawn mesh and handed to [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mJ12\u001b[39m](#j12)'s\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m7\u001b[12G\u001b[22m \u001b[14Gcollision file; `s\u001b[33Gcket-` nodes\u001b[46Gkept in the cooked GLB,\u001b[70Gtheir transfo\u001b[84Gms found by \u001b[97Game on\u001b[104Gthe\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m7\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRename built and its suites\u001b[31Gpass;\u001b[37Gcommitting\u001b[48Gboth\u001b[53Gbranches\u001b[62Gnow.\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mWorking…\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;218;124;92mTinkering…\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
